   "challenge.subheading2": "Solution",
   "challenge.text2": "We designed a “Find Your Drive Course” form right under the hero, course pages that answer the common questions in one place, and an apply flow where students pick a course, truck, date and time in under a minute, all in a mobile-first layout.",
